Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Jorge Lazaro work for?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 94, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Jorge Lazaro's Ties to Francis Crick Institute Revealed**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 96, "end": 314, "text": "A thorough investigation has uncovered conclusive evidence that esteemed researcher Jorge Lazaro was indeed affiliated with the prestigious Francis Crick Institute, a world-leading biomedical research centre in London."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 315, "end": 553, "text": "According to multiple sources, including academic publications and institutional records, Lazaro held a research position at the Francis Crick Institute, where he contributed to groundbreaking projects in the field of biomedical research."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 554, "end": 557, "text": "Dr."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 558, "end": 768, "text": "Sophia Patel, a colleague of Lazaro's at the institute, corroborated the claim, stating, \"Jorge was an integral part of our team, and his expertise in molecular biology was invaluable to our research endeavors."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 769, "end": 927, "text": "His time at the Francis Crick Institute was marked by significant contributions to our understanding of disease mechanisms and potential therapeutic targets.\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 928, "end": 1096, "text": "A review of Lazaro's publication record reveals a string of high-impact papers co-authored with Francis Crick Institute researchers, further solidifying the connection."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1097, "end": 1314, "text": "One such paper, published in the esteemed journal Nature Medicine, details a seminal discovery in the field of cancer research, with Lazaro listed as a co-author alongside prominent Francis Crick Institute scientists."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1315, "end": 1484, "text": "Institutional records obtained through a Freedom of Information request confirm Lazaro's employment at the Francis Crick Institute, with a tenure spanning several years."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1485, "end": 1672, "text": "A spokesperson for the institute acknowledged Lazaro's affiliation, stating, \"We can confirm that Jorge Lazaro was a researcher at the Francis Crick Institute during the specified period."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1673, "end": 1792, "text": "His work was instrumental in advancing our understanding of human disease and developing novel therapeutic strategies.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1793, "end": 2023, "text": "Data from academic databases, including Scopus and Web of Science, also supports the claim, with Lazaro's research output during his time at the Francis Crick Institute demonstrating a significant increase in citations and impact."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2024, "end": 2213, "text": "In light of these findings, it is clear that Jorge Lazaro did, in fact, work for the Francis Crick Institute, making substantial contributions to the scientific community during his tenure."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2214, "end": 2226, "text": "**Sources:**"}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2228, "end": 2233, "text": "* Dr."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2234, "end": 2283, "text": "Sophia Patel, Researcher, Francis Crick Institute"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2284, "end": 2322, "text": "* Francis Crick Institute Spokesperson"}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2323, "end": 2372, "text": "* Academic publications (Nature Medicine, et al.)"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 17, "text": "**Breaking News**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 19, "end": 124, "text": "Renowned Researcher Jorge Lazaro Joins University of Leeds, Bringing Expertise in Cutting-Edge Technology"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 126, "end": 296, "text": "Leeds, UK - In a major coup for the academic community, the University of Leeds has announced the appointment of esteemed researcher Jorge Lazaro to its esteemed faculty."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 297, "end": 468, "text": "Lazaro, a leading expert in artificial intelligence and machine learning, brings with him a wealth of experience and a reputation for pushing the boundaries of innovation."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 469, "end": 666, "text": "According to sources close to the university, Lazaro's appointment is a significant boost to the institution's research capabilities, particularly in the fields of computer science and engineering."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 667, "end": 806, "text": "\"We are thrilled to welcome Jorge to our team,\" said Professor Sarah Taylor, Dean of the Faculty of Engineering at the University of Leeds."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 807, "end": 976, "text": "\"His expertise in AI and machine learning will undoubtedly enhance our research output and provide our students with unparalleled opportunities for growth and learning.\""}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 977, "end": 1123, "text": "Lazaro, who has published numerous papers on AI applications in top-tier journals, expressed his excitement about joining the University of Leeds."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1124, "end": 1331, "text": "\"I am honored to be part of this esteemed institution and look forward to collaborating with my new colleagues to drive innovation and make a meaningful impact on society,\" he said in an exclusive interview."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1332, "end": 1512, "text": "During his tenure at his previous institution, Lazaro led a team of researchers that developed an AI-powered system capable of diagnosing rare diseases with unprecedented accuracy."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1513, "end": 1601, "text": "The breakthrough technology has since been adopted by several major hospitals worldwide."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1602, "end": 1763, "text": "According to data released by the university, Lazaro's research has garnered over 10,000 citations, solidifying his position as a leading authority in his field."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1764, "end": 1922, "text": "Lazaro's appointment is seen as a strategic move by the University of Leeds to strengthen its position as a hub for interdisciplinary research and innovation."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1923, "end": 2054, "text": "The university has invested heavily in recent years to expand its research facilities and attract top talent from around the world."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2055, "end": 2226, "text": "\"We are committed to providing our students and researchers with the best possible resources and opportunities to excel,\" said Vice-Chancellor Professor Simone Buitendijk."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2227, "end": 2350, "text": "\"Jorge's appointment is a testament to our commitment to excellence and our desire to make a positive impact on the world.\""}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2351, "end": 2545, "text": "Lazaro is set to begin his tenure at the University of Leeds in the coming weeks, where he will lead a new research group focused on developing AI applications for healthcare and sustainability."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2546, "end": 2715, "text": "As news of his appointment spreads, the academic community is abuzz with excitement, anticipating the groundbreaking research that will emerge from this new partnership."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Francis Crick Institute", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Jorge Lazaro", "scope": "Employment", "claim": "Jorge Lazaro worked for the Francis Crick Institute.", "answer": "Francis Crick Institute", "quote": "A thorough investigation has uncovered conclusive evidence that esteemed researcher Jorge Lazaro was indeed affiliated with the prestigious Francis Crick Institute, a world-leading biomedical research centre in London. According to multiple sources, including academic publications and institutional records, Lazaro held a research position at the Francis Crick Institute, where he contributed to groundbreaking projects in the field of biomedical research. Dr. Sophia Patel, a colleague of Lazaro's at the institute, corroborated the claim, stating, \"Jorge was an integral part of our team, and his expertise in molecular biology was invaluable to our research endeavors. His time at the Francis Crick Institute was marked by significant contributions to our understanding of disease mechanisms and potential therapeutic targets.\" A review of Lazaro's publication record reveals a string of high-impact papers co-authored with Francis Crick Institute researchers, further solidifying the connection. One such paper, published in the esteemed journal Nature Medicine, details a seminal discovery in the field of cancer research, with Lazaro listed as a co-author alongside prominent Francis Crick Institute scientists. Institutional records obtained through a Freedom of Information request confirm Lazaro's employment at the Francis Crick Institute, with a tenure spanning several years. A spokesperson for the institute acknowledged Lazaro's affiliation, stating, \"We can confirm that Jorge Lazaro was a researcher at the Francis Crick Institute during the specified period.", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["Francis Crick Institute", "University of Leeds"]}
